  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why does this happen",
      "char_file": "이불_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Obstructive sleep apnea means",
        "your airway narrows or",
        "collapses while you sleep",
        "",
        "Nearly 1 in 4 people with it",
        "have a normal body weight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sleeping on your back",
      "char_file": "이불_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sleeping flat on your back",
        "lets gravity pull your tongue",
        "backward against your airway",
        "",
        "Back sleepers get 2x+ the",
        "airway blockages side sleepers do"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix: sleep on your side",
      "char_file": "이불_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try sleeping on your side",
        "instead of your back",
        "",
        "Less gravity pull on your tongue,",
        "an easier path for air"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "A pillow that's too high",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A pillow that's too high",
        "tucks your chin toward your chest",
        "",
        "That compresses and narrows",
        "your airway for hours"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix: lower your pillow",
      "char_file": "베개_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Pick a pillow that keeps",
        "your neck level, not bent",
        "",
        "A neutral neck means",
        "a more open airway"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sedatives & muscle relaxants",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sedatives and muscle relaxants",
        "relax airway muscles too",
        "",
        "They also dull the reflex",
        "that wakes you when breathing stops"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Fix: talk to your doctor",
      "char_file": "알약_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Check with your doctor",
        "before relying on sleep meds",
        "",
        "Still gasping awake or exhausted?",
        "See a sleep clinic for a real diagnosis"
      ]
    }
  ],
